# Vulnerabilities acknowledged but not fixable in this repository.
#
# Each entry must name the component, say why it cannot be fixed here, and
# link a tracking issue. Nothing goes in this file to make a build green.
# The full scan result is still uploaded to the Security tab, so an ignored
# finding stays visible.

# CVE-2025-68121 -- crypto/tls certificate validation, Go stdlib v1.23.3.
#
# The affected binary is shipped inside ghcr.io/home-assistant/base-python,
# Home Assistant's own base image. This repository adds no Go code and
# cannot rebuild that binary; the fix has to come from an upstream base
# image rebuild, which Dependabot will bring in.
#
# Nothing in this app reaches that binary at runtime: the service is Python,
# and its TLS is CPython's, not Go's.
#
# Tracked in: https://github.com/resace3/android-timeline-home-assistant/issues/2
CVE-2025-68121
